---
layout: base.njk
title: "The Downsizing Journal | Padilla Advisory Group"
description: "Straight-talking articles on downsizing in Los Angeles — timing, taxes (Prop 19), preparing to sell, and moving forward. Written by Alex Padilla."
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="glow-top"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-rule"></div>
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ site.blogName }}</p>
    <h1>Clear thinking on downsizing in {{ site.city }}.</h1>
    <p class="intro">Timing, taxes, preparing to sell, and moving forward &mdash; written for longtime homeowners by {{ site.advisor.short }}. No pitch, just what actually matters.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="post-list">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="items">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <span class="meta">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
        <span class="more">Read the article &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
      {% if collections.posts.length === 0 %}
      <p style="padding:2rem 0;color:#4a5461;">New articles are on the way.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
